@startuml
' ---------- Диаграмма последовательности: Формировать отчёт ----------
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Руководитель" as Manager
participant "WebClient" as Client
participant "ReportService" as Report
participant "TaskService" as Task
participant "IdentityService" as Identity

Manager -> Client: Выбор проекта и периода
activate Client

Client -> Report: GET /reports/project/{id}
activate Report

Report -> Task: GET /projects/{id}
Task --> Report: ProjectResponse

Report -> Task: GET /tasks?projectId={id}
Task --> Report: TaskResponse[]

Report -> Task: GET /catalogs/statuses
Task --> Report: статусы

loop по каждой задаче
  Report -> Task: GET /catalogs/history/{id}
  Task --> Report: TaskHistoryResponse[]
end

Report -> Identity: GET /users
Identity --> Report: UserResponse[]

Report --> Client: 200 OK, ProjectReportResponse
deactivate Report

Client --> Manager: Отчёт по статусам

deactivate Client

@enduml
